# src/apps/android/app/src/main

## Purpose
Android main source set. Resource subtrees are documented here but excluded from .context injection to avoid packaging side effects.

## Contents
- Direct files (1): `AndroidManifest.xml`
- Child folders: `assets/`, `java/`.
- `res/` contains Android packaged resources and is intentionally excluded from nested `.context` files to avoid AAPT/resource side effects.

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Android/Gradle source or build metadata; runtime calls enter the generated Go mobile binding rather than a second native runtime.

## Invariants
- Android lifecycle authority remains VpnEngineService → generated Go mobile binding → canonical daemon/system owners.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
- Update this context when ownership, supported interfaces, or child-folder meaning changes; do not use it as a changelog.
